  (text "75k 1% REXT and independent 100n VREG bypass per NXP datasheet. IRQ outputs share a wired-OR line.\nRun electrode wires away from motor cables. Pad sizes, shell thickness and wire capacitance need actual-shell tuning.\nNo electrodes or copper over the charging coil, screen or antenna keep-outs."
    (at 15 24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "451c2169-0964-538d-b969-eaa8377c2c97")
